Certainly! Below are the MQTT client request message templates formatted as specified. The templates include various MQTT operations such as CONNECT, SUBSCRIBE, PUBLISH, UNSUBSCRIBE, and DISCONNECT, along with variations for Quality of Service (QoS), reconnect, will, authentication, wildcard topics, and duplicate CONNECT messages.

```plaintext
CONNECT: [
